---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | spousalsupportcalc.com';
const description = 'Privacy policy for spousalsupportcalc.com — data collection, cookies, Google AdSense, and Google Analytics practices.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: May 2026.</em></p>
  <p>spousalsupportcalc.com is operated by The Click Lab. We take privacy seriously and describe our practices in plain language.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>Calculator inputs are processed in your browser only &mdash; we do not transmit or store them on our servers. We have no access to the income figures, marriage duration, or state information you enter into the calculator. We use Google Analytics to understand aggregate traffic patterns; this collects general information like country, device type, and pages visited, but does not identify individual users.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>We serve display advertising through Google AdSense (publisher ID: ca-pub-6434377544325972). Google AdSense cookies serve ads based on your prior visits to websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising via <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google&rsquo;s Ads Settings</a>. Refusing advertising cookies will not affect your ability to use the calculator or read our guides.</p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>We use Google AdSense (advertising) and Google Analytics (aggregate traffic analysis), both subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google&rsquo;s Privacy Policy</a>. We do not sell, share, or transfer reader data to any other third parties.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>EU, UK, and California residents have rights to access, correct, or delete personal data held about them. Because we do not collect identifying personal information directly, there is typically no personal data to access or delete. Contact us via <a href="/contact">our contact page</a> with any privacy-related requests or questions.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>Material changes to this policy will be announced via banner on the homepage. The &ldquo;last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.</p>
</BaseLayout>
